// Syncthing ignore patterns for this folder.
// Must exist on EVERY device syncing it -- patterns are per-device, not synced.

// Git metadata. Git rewrites refs/index on nearly every command, so two
// devices touching the repo at once produce *.sync-conflict copies inside
// .git and can clobber HEAD/refs across machines. Sync the working tree
// only; move history around with `git push` / `git pull` instead.
.git

// Build outputs / local state -- machine-specific, never worth syncing.
result
result-*
.direnv
.devenv

// Clean up any conflict copies that already exist.
(?d)**.sync-conflict-*
